    (comment 1 "U1: Ai-Thinker Rd-03D / HLK-LD2450 (5V supply, 3.3V UART 256000 8N1)")
    (comment 2 "U2: Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32-S3 (D7/GPIO44 RX, D6/GPIO43 TX, D4 SDA, D5 SCL, A0 VBAT)")
    (comment 3 "U3: 0.96in OLED SSD1306 I2C 0x3C (3.3V) | BT1: Li-Po 1S 1200mAh PCM + SW1 SS22G08")
