  (lib_symbols
  )

  (text "NETLIST SUMMARY (Verified against primary datasheets 2026-11-26):\n\n1. POWER & BATTERY DOMAIN (Complete Variant):\n   - BT1_POS (3.0..4.2V Protected Li-Po) -> SW1 Pin 1\n   - SW1 Pin 2 -> NET VBAT_SW\n   - VBAT_SW -> U2 PAD BAT+ (onboard 4.2V Li-Po charger) AND U4 VIN+ (5.0V Boost) AND R1_1 (100k 1%)\n   - U4 VOUT (+5.0V_RADAR, isolated from VUSB!) -> C1_POS (100uF Low-ESR) -> U1 J1 Pin 1 (5V)\n   - Minimal USB-Only Variant (no BT1/U4): U2 Pin 14 (VUSB 5V) -> C1_POS -> U1 J1 Pin 1 (5V)\n   - GND -> BT1_NEG, U2 PAD BAT-, U2 Pin 13 (GND), U4 GND, R2_2, C1_NEG, U1 J1 Pin 2, U3 GND\n\n2. BATTERY TELEMETRY DIVIDER:\n   - R1 (100k 1%): VBAT_SW to VBAT_ADC\n   - R2 (100k 1%): VBAT_ADC to GND\n   - VBAT_ADC (1.50..2.10V, 21 uA) -> U2 Pin 1 (D0 / A0 / GPIO1)\n\n3. UART1 TRANSPARENT BRIDGE (256000 8N1, 3.3V CMOS):\n   - U1 J1 Pin 3 (RADAR_TX, 3.3V) -> U2 Pin 8 (D7 / RX / GPIO44)\n   - U2 Pin 7 (D6 / TX / GPIO43, 3.3V) -> U1 J1 Pin 4 (RADAR_RX, 3.3V)\n\n4. I2C PPI DISPLAY BUS (400 kHz, 3.3V CMOS):\n   - U2 Pin 12 (3V3) -> U3 Pin VCC\n   - U2 Pin 5 (D4 / SDA / GPIO5) <-> U3 Pin SDA\n   - U2 Pin 6 (D5 / SCL / GPIO6) -> U3 Pin SCL"
